§ `s 8(2)(c), (3) -- entitlement on termination`

-- c056 (assuming Liam had 8 years with the employer he leaves, 2021 to 2029): resigning keeps a pro rata 104/15 weeks.
-- c056 (assuming his apprenticeship counts, s 6(7), so 12 years): 8 2/3 weeks plus 2/10 of 8 2/3 = 10.4 weeks.
-- c072 (assuming Chloe's counted service is 9 years once her unpaid parental leave is left out): 7.8 weeks, not lost.
#ASSERT `How many weeks am I entitled to on termination` 6.9 `I resigned` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `How many weeks am I entitled to on termination` 8 `I resigned` EQUALS (104 DIVIDED BY 15)
#ASSERT `How many weeks am I entitled to on termination` 9 `I resigned` EQUALS 7.8
#ASSERT `How many weeks am I entitled to on termination` 9 `my employer dismissed me for serious misconduct` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `How many weeks am I entitled to on termination` 8.5 `I died` EQUALS (221 DIVIDED BY 30)
#ASSERT `How many weeks am I entitled to on termination` 10 `I resigned` EQUALS (26 DIVIDED BY 3)
#ASSERT `How many weeks am I entitled to on termination` 12 `I resigned` EQUALS 10.4
#ASSERT `How many weeks am I entitled to on termination` 12.5 `I resigned` EQUALS 10.4
#ASSERT `How many weeks am I entitled to on termination` 12 `my employer dismissed me for serious misconduct` EQUALS (26 DIVIDED BY 3)
#ASSERT `How many weeks am I entitled to on termination` 17 `my employer dismissed me for another reason` EQUALS (221 DIVIDED BY 15)

#ASSERT `How many weeks must I be paid out` 12 `I resigned` (26 DIVIDED BY 3) EQUALS (26 DIVIDED BY 15)

§ `ss 7, 7A, 7B, 7C -- ordinary pay`

`a full-timer on 38 hours at $40` MEANS PayFacts WITH
    `I am paid wholly or partly by results` IS FALSE
    `my average weekly pay over the last 365 days` IS 0
    `my normal weekly hours` IS 38
    `my ordinary hourly rate` IS 40
    `my casual loading as a fraction` IS 0
    `weekly cash value of board and lodging I will not take` IS 0

`a casual on 20 hours at $30 with a 25% loading` MEANS PayFacts WITH
    `I am paid wholly or partly by results` IS FALSE
    `my average weekly pay over the last 365 days` IS 0
    `my normal weekly hours` IS 20
    `my ordinary hourly rate` IS 30
    `my casual loading as a fraction` IS 0.25
    `weekly cash value of board and lodging I will not take` IS 0

`a commission earner averaging $1,200` MEANS PayFacts WITH
    `I am paid wholly or partly by results` IS TRUE
    `my average weekly pay over the last 365 days` IS 1200
    `my normal weekly hours` IS 0
    `my ordinary hourly rate` IS 0
    `my casual loading as a fraction` IS 0
    `weekly cash value of board and lodging I will not take` IS 0

